name unifront
category Package
revision 67054
shortdesc Give notes a unique front page for every chapter and section
relocated 1
longdesc This package can help you format your notes easily and give
longdesc them a unique front page for every chapter and section. It
longdesc calculates your progress and then displays the progress bar
longdesc under the title. It also displays a partial table of contents
longdesc under every progress bar and only shows the subdirectories of
longdesc the current part. To generate this, you can simply enter your
longdesc current completed titles with a command that accepts Variable
longdesc Arguments. Still, that also helps you review your notes. You
longdesc can also customise the colour of the bar.
runfiles size=2
 RELOC/tex/latex/unifront/unifront.sty
catalogue-contact-announce https://github.com/weifanw/unifront/wiki
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/weifanw/unifront/issues
catalogue-contact-development https://github.com/weifanw/unifront/pulls
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/weifanw/unifront
catalogue-contact-support https://github.com/weifanw/unifront/wiki
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/unifront
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics toc-etc notes
catalogue-version 1.0
